  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264015/description_f2f473a4-9c8e-41f7-a028-a31d4de5eb96.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"425\" height=\"125\"></p>\n<p><strong>Right Click and Milk</strong>&nbsp;是一款專為&nbsp;<strong>Farmer's Delight</strong>&nbsp;設計的簡易模組擴充，讓收集牛奶變得更加輕鬆。</p>\n<p>手持空玻璃瓶，對著牛、山羊或哞菇點擊右鍵，即可獲得一瓶牛奶作為回饋。</p>\n<p>再也不用來回奔波去拿桶子，或在桌面上製作牛奶瓶了！</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6RJJbLp.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"359\"></p>",
